        "La función\n",
        "\n",
        "``` python\n",
        "pd.get_dummies()\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "realiza una codificación *one-hot*.\n",
        "\n",
        "Una observación podría quedar representada como\n",
        "\n",
        "$$(1,0,0,0),$$\n",
        "\n",
        "otra como\n",
        "\n",
        "$$(0,1,0,0),$$\n",
        "\n",
        "etc.\n",
        "\n",
        "Cada fila tiene exactamente un valor igual a $1$.\n",
