      "source": [
        "Los valores deben coincidir salvo pequeñas diferencias numéricas de redondeo.\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {.callout-warning icon=\"false\"}\n",
        "## 🧠 Pregunta\n",
        "\n",
        "¿Por qué el intercepto coincide con la media del grupo de referencia y los demás coeficientes representan diferencias entre grupos?\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.callout-tip collapse=\"true\" icon=\"false\"}\n",
        "## Solución\n",
        "\n",
        "El modelo es\n",
        "\n",
        "$$Y_i\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\beta_0\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_1C_1(X_i)\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_2C_2(X_i)\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\beta_3C_3(X_i)\n",
        "+\n",
        "\\varepsilon_i.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Para el grupo de referencia, todas las variables indicadoras valen cero, por lo que\n",
        "\n",
        "$$E[Y\\mid C_0]\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\beta_0.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Por mínimos cuadrados,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat\\beta_0\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_0}.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Para el grupo $C_1$,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$E[Y\\mid C_1]\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\beta_0+\\beta_1.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Por tanto,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat\\beta_0+\\hat\\beta_1\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_1}.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Como\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat\\beta_0\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_0},$$\n",
        "\n",
        "entonces\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat\\beta_1\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_1}\n",
        "-\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_0}.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "De manera análoga,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat\\beta_j\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_j}\n",
        "-\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_0},\n",
        "\\qquad j=1,2,3.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Así, con intercepto, los coeficientes distintos al intercepto no son medias de grupo, sino diferencias respecto a la categoría de referencia.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## El `summary()` del modelo de mínimos cuadrados\n",
        "\n",
        "Veamos ahora el resumen completo del modelo."
