        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Cada fila representa una edad de `age_grid`.\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {.callout-warning icon=\"false\"}\n",
        "## 🧠 Pregunta\n",
        "\n",
        "¿Por qué sería incorrecto utilizar nuevamente\n",
        "\n",
        "``` python\n",
        "pd.qcut(age_grid, 4)\n",
