        "Para una observación perteneciente a $C_2$ tenemos\n",
        "\n",
        "$$C_1=0,\\qquad\n",
        "C_2=1,\\qquad\n",
        "C_3=0.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Por tanto,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat Y\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\hat\\beta_0+\\hat\\beta_2.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Sustituyendo,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat Y\n",
        "=\n",
        "94.16+25.03\n",
        "=\n",
        "119.19.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Por tanto, el salario medio estimado para ese grupo es aproximadamente\n",
        "\n",
        "$$119.19.$$\n",
        ":::\n",
        "::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Intervalos de confianza\n",
