        "::: {.callout-tip collapse=\"true\" icon=\"false\"}\n",
        "## Solución\n",
        "\n",
        "En el modelo de mínimos cuadrados,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat\\beta_0\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_0}$$\n",
        "\n",
        "es la media salarial del grupo de referencia.\n",
        "\n",
        "Para los demás grupos,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat\\beta_j\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_j}\n",
        "-\n",
        "\\bar Y_{C_0}.$$\n",
        "\n",
        "Por tanto, los coeficientes representan diferencias de medias respecto al grupo de referencia.\n",
        "\n",
        "En la regresión logística,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat\\beta_0\n",
        "=\n",
        "\\operatorname{logit}(\\hat p_0)$$\n",
        "\n",
        "representa los log-odds del grupo de referencia.\n",
        "\n",
        "Para $j=1,2,3$,\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\\hat\\beta_j\n",
